WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.721
Greater than ANY means the outer age must be greater
than at least one age

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:09.785
returned by the inner query For a nonempty set
without NULL complications

00:00:10.048 --> 00:00:15.601
a helpful intuition is to compare with the minimum
If your age is greater

00:00:15.614 --> 00:00:21.288
than the smallest returned age at least one
comparison succeeds Run

00:00:21.314 --> 00:00:24.078
the query and compare the result with that intuition
